config BR2_PACKAGE_SIGMASTAR_OSDRV_SENSORS
	bool "sigmastar-osdrv-sensors"
	depends on BR2_SOC_VENDOR_SIGMASTAR
	depends on BR2_LINUX_KERNEL
	help
	  SigmaStar sensor driver kernel modules, built from source for the
	  configured Infinity family.

	  Produces sensor_config.ko (the i2c probe that backs `ipcinfo -s`)
	  and one sensor_<model>_mipi.ko per supported sensor. All of them
	  are installed; load_sigmastar picks one at runtime.

	  https://github.com/openipc/sensors
